		},
		{
			"id": "leaf",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### Leaf structure\nCuticle, epidermis, mesophyll, veins; xylem and phloem\n\n[[Leaf Structure and Water Transport|open note]]",
			"x": -40,
			"y": 1530,
			"width": 330,
			"height": 170
		},
		{
			"id": "stom",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### Stomata and transpiration\nGuard cells open and close the pore: CO₂ in, water out\n\n[[Stomata and Transpiration|open note]]",
			"x": 320,
			"y": 1530,
			"width": 330,
			"height": 170
		},
		{
			"id": "lab",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### Lab: water retention\n% mass change; stomata\n\n[[Lab - Water Retention in Plants|open note]]",
			"x": 680,
			"y": 1530,
			"width": 330,
			"height": 170
		},
		{
			"id": "photo",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### Photorespiration, C4, CAM\nRuBisCO binds O₂ when stomata close; C4 = space, CAM = time\n\n[[Photorespiration, C4 and CAM Plants|open note]]",
			"x": 1040,
			"y": 1530,
			"width": 330,
			"height": 170
		},
		{
			"id": "amph",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### Amphipathic molecules\nEthanol and phospholipids; ethanol releases membrane pigments\n\n[[Amphipathic Molecules and Membranes|open note]]",
			"x": 1400,
			"y": 1530,
			"width": 330,
			"height": 170
		},
		{
			"id": "act10",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "### Activity 10\nDecolorize a leaf, stain for starch: chlorophyll and light needed\n\n[[Activity 10 - Pigments and Energy Transformation in Leaf|open note]]",
